-- arguments: the firm carries on business; that business is the main activity of the trust or company service provider
#ASSERT `reg 12(3) the firm is an off-the-shelf firm` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 12(3) the firm is an off-the-shelf firm` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 12(3) the firm is an off-the-shelf firm` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

