#ASSERT `reg 13(3) the person is a letting agent` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `reg 13(2): dealing in land outside the United Kingdom (src:329)`
-- the fields: the interest is in land in the United Kingdom; it is capable of being owned or held as a separate interest
