#ASSERT `reg 14(1)(f) the thing is a work of art` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `reg 14(2): a payment in cash (src:355-357)`
-- arguments: the payment is made in cash; paid to a person other than the other party for the other party's benefit; paid into a bank account for the other party's benefit
