#ASSERT `reg 14A(3)(c) the thing is a cryptoasset for sub-paragraphs (a), (b) and (c) of paragraph (1)` (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `reg 14A(3)(c) the thing is a cryptoasset for sub-paragraphs (a), (b) and (c) of paragraph (1)` (JUST FALSE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `reg 14A(3)(c) the thing is a cryptoasset for sub-paragraphs (a), (b) and (c) of paragraph (1)` NOTHING FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `reg 14A(3)(b): money (src:370-374)`
#ASSERT `reg 14A(3)(b) the thing is money` `reg 14A(3)(b)(i) money in sterling` EQUALS JUST TRUE
